&_nc_oc=AdrliWvbPphLX6K_2BjZOP884tDioHOAN3jG-X6dUD5mRa-G7qSVpB-YqAHyNhkvJe4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPA9PaswKKpm86IJwItOYkoOpAJfWOF16Jm-VcuIX-B_A&oe=6AD3913E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NLBg_3Pr5ssQ7kNvwG182NJ&_nc_oc=AdrQUXOLbZf2OgL6GDXU_8t9sy5Nwl0zk0VjYTuRv5aPCAWM5AJDpsjGNDG-OA9LP7w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNAsj6Fh0gwY_Lti0ZC5Qj1wloSbqZG46vFps7fnx7k6g&oe=6AD3A23C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1m1BibaX3O8Q7kNvwFkQDkw&_nc_oc=AdoN-vHIP1Rrkl8ZquojFdhe7vsDQhjllw3Sh0XDZYlOKALJIu8EnA4H0fERHrUBQT4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM9AZrNjCpIwmwuW9iPbIKSaYdUGFXl4qJJmrvqSez3JA&oe=6AD38887"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xdKOLICmsU4Q7kNvwHalckK&_nc_oc=AdqplRIqfAuUcvnm9LqM7uQF627AFuCdFpOnc3rPMVJdOpZdC6vpwkaVptC_J4m6wh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPvpNMJVUPKYK4IhjtOPvwc7c36_3S_8IKRHs-qAzj4Jw&oe=6AD3AC95"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E8LmdERx_goQ7kNvwG3OD7U&_nc_oc=AdpL2egMa-hbr8rZk6WIsl8qKv_foC6e8zPOE2UcvTSDrrWvIMWRqHVWSKlIsixAKYw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMcggt9abYwLFtE2grhxRAy2jmS8HZshMF8-u9O6LmB6A&oe=6AD3B924"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.